  "body": "It seems to me that currently `referrerpolicy` can be used for `<img>` but not for `<audio>` or `<video>`.\r\nIt would be great if this could be used in the same way.\r\n\r\nI'm new to standardization. If this issue should be open at https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy, I'll reopen it there.\r\n\r\nEDIT: I also opened an issue on w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy#160 ",
